  "helpTopBar2": "The wooden buttons, from left to right: Identify (camera), Manual (on/off switch), My Collection (bookshelf), Plugins (jack plug) and Help (question mark). Their names show up one by one when the app opens. The last button shows the lyrics on your TV.",
